          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ lar wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä bi gɔy dhɔaar gua̱n diaal te wi̱i̱dɛ, gaat diaal amäni nɛy tin di̱t bikɛ guic ni jɛ, bikɛ ce̱tnikɛ kuak li̱eeri kɛnɛ dha̱a̱ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wee, ɛn lo̱c in ca pua̱t piny ɛ bumɛ bɛ luɛ̈k. Jɛn ba jɛ jɔap piny a bɛ tɛɛth, kä bi kuak tin kapɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈n a bikɛ tiath,” ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
